WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.582
The next time it crosses your sky.

00:03.282 --> 00:08.487
This is the station at the top of its next pass over you, with your ground below.

00:08.937 --> 00:15.537
From where you stand it looks like a bright star moving steadily across the sky, with no blinking lights.
